Accounts (no entries stored yet)
  Places where money is kept, such as a bank account or a wallet.
  Each one has:
    - name
    - opening balance

People (1 entry stored so far)
  People whose spending is tracked, such as family members.
  Each one has:
    - name

Categories (2 entries stored so far)
  Groups for spending and income, such as groceries or salary.
  Each one has:
    - name

Transactions (3 entries stored so far)
  Each payment received or made.
  Each one has:
    - account
    - category
    - occurred on
    - amount
    - transfer to account (optional)
    - notes (optional)
    - person (optional)

Every entry also remembers when it was added and when it last changed.
